\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Available gating-institution output per 100,000 EU/EC population, 1960--2025. The coloured series use each institution's own reported output measure; the population denominator is the EU/EC member-state population at each date, with enlargement and Brexit breaks. The dark red line is a chained median index of per-capita growth (right axis, 1960 = 100); each observed interval is annualised and interpolated across missing years, so a new observation does not create a level jump when a series enters or leaves. The population is a contextual scale denominator, not a population at risk of admission or appointment.}}{11}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:gating-trajectories}{{3}{11}{Available gating-institution output per 100,000 EU/EC population, 1960--2025. The coloured series use each institution's own reported output measure; the population denominator is the EU/EC member-state population at each date, with enlargement and Brexit breaks. The dark red line is a chained median index of per-capita growth (right axis, 1960 = 100); each observed interval is annualised and interpolated across missing years, so a new observation does not create a level jump when a series enters or leaves. The population is a contextual scale denominator, not a population at risk of admission or appointment}{figure.3}{}}
